1
00:00:00,633 --> 00:00:02,133
(door slams)

2
00:00:02,134 --> 00:00:05,704
(sighs)

3
00:00:05,705 --> 00:00:06,735
(Howard:)Raj, wait.

4
00:00:06,739 --> 00:00:08,939
(Raj:)What took you so long?

5
00:00:11,377 --> 00:00:12,447
LEONARD:
Buddy, I know me

6
00:00:12,445 --> 00:00:14,775
(Sheldon:)moving in with Penny
feels like a big change,

7
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,110
(Leonard:)but it's not.

8
00:00:16,115 --> 00:00:17,315
(Sheldon:)How can you say that?

9
00:00:17,316 --> 00:00:18,316
(Sheldon:)Amy's gone,

10
00:00:18,317 --> 00:00:19,917
(Sheldon:)and you two are married now,

11
00:00:19,919 --> 00:00:22,619
(Sheldon:)so it's only a matter of time
before you're gone, too.

12
00:00:22,621 --> 00:00:24,091
(Penny:)Okay, you don't know
what's gonna happen.

13
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,260
(Sheldon:)No, I do.

14
00:00:25,257 --> 00:00:26,827
(Sheldon:)Eventually you'll want
more space,

15
00:00:26,826 --> 00:00:28,196
(Sheldon:)and you'll move into a house,

16
00:00:28,194 --> 00:00:30,364
(Sheldon:)and then instead of dinner
a couple of times a week,

17
00:00:30,363 --> 00:00:31,933
(Sheldon:)it'll only be a couple
of times a month,

18
00:00:31,931 --> 00:00:33,131
(Sheldon:)and then it'll only be

19
00:00:33,132 --> 00:00:34,432
(Sheldon:)on special occasions,

20
00:00:34,433 --> 00:00:37,773
(Sheldon:)like when Bernadette
divorces Wolowitz.

21
00:00:38,604 --> 00:00:40,304
Or-or-or like

22
00:00:40,306 --> 00:00:41,906
(Sheldon:)when Koothrappali's
weird girlfriend

23
00:00:41,907 --> 00:00:44,407
(Sheldon:)admits where she buried
his body.

24
00:00:46,112 --> 00:00:47,342
(Sheldon:)Or Amy's wedding,

25
00:00:47,346 --> 00:00:50,016
(Sheldon:)where she's marrying
someone better than me.

26
00:00:50,015 --> 00:00:52,485
(Penny:)Okay, look,

27
00:00:52,485 --> 00:00:54,585
(Penny:)we don't need
to rush into anything.

28
00:00:54,587 --> 00:00:55,887
(Penny:)All right?

29
00:00:55,888 --> 00:00:58,458
(Penny:)Maybe instead of Leonard
moving in with me,

